```jinja
{{ ansible_facts['distribution_version'] is version('12.04', '>=') }}
{{ sample_version_var is version('1.0', operator='lt', strict=True) }}
```

Operators: `<, lt, <=, le, >, gt, >=, ge, ==, =, eq, !=, <>, ne`.

`version_type` (2.11+, exclusive with `strict`): `loose` (default; accepts any format but can surprise), `strict`, `semver`/`semantic`, `pep440`. (`version_compare` was renamed to `version` in 2.5.)
